    "summary": "ONNX C++ checker permits external-data paths outside the model directory",
    "details": "Before ONNX 1.13.0, the C++ tensor checker does not confine the external-data location to the model directory. Both JLLs ship this checker. It checks whether the referenced file exists, but does not load its contents; the JLLs do not ship the Python external-data loader or ONNX Runtime.",
